          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"https://millionairepartnership.com/webclass-d24#aff=sanjay457\"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/millionaire-712x639.webp\" alt=\"Millionaire Partner System™ \"></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Mobirise Website Builder</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Millionaire Partner System is an online marketing program with affiliate business training designed for beginners and would-be entrepreneurs to generate their online incomes through pre-designed tools, systems and business trainings. This program is popularly associated with online marketer Glynn Kosky and is presented as a simple way of generating an online business without any complex technical expertise or marketing experience.\n<br><br>The core idea behind Millionaire Partner System is automation and partnership-based affiliate marketing. Instead of building a business completely from scratch, users are given access to pre-built sales funnels, ready-made landing pages, automated email follow-up systems, and high-ticket affiliate offers that are already designed to convert visitors into customers. The goal is to reduce the learning curve and allow users to focus mainly on driving traffic and learning marketing strategies.<br><br>&nbsp;One of the biggest features of the system is its “done-for-you” business model. Many people struggle with complicated website design, copywriting, product creation, and technical setup when trying to start an online business. Millionaire Partner System claims to remove much of that complexity by providing users with ready-to-use tools and marketing assets. According to official descriptions, members receive access to sales funnels, automated email campaigns, training videos, traffic-generation strategies, and mentorship support.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"https://a2c97pj8k6frwc65kex9l-unzp.hop.clickbank.net\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-shopping-cart mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Buy Now!</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
