          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>The Millionaire Partner System may work out well for individuals who are very serious about affiliate marketing education and are also committed enough to consistently generate traffic, create content, and engage in other online marketing practices. This system has been created in order to make most of the complicated aspects of building an online business easier and simpler. There are pre-made funnels, auto-email responders, training modules, and high-end affiliate products available on this system.</div><div><br></div><div>One of the reasons why the system might work effectively is the “done-for-you” model. Instead of spending months designing websites, writing sales pages or creating products, users get ready-to-use marketing systems that have already been optimized for conversions. Thus, beginners can spend less time on learning traffic and audience generation techniques and more time on other aspects of their activity. Some users claim that they launched their funnels in hours and earned their first commissions.</div><div><br></div><div>Another major factor is the training and mentorship support. Millionaire Partner System includes video lessons, traffic strategies, funnel guidance, and online business education that can help beginners understand how affiliate marketing works in real-world situations. Many reviews mention that the structured step-by-step training makes the learning process less overwhelming for new users.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div>However, effectiveness depends heavily on the user’s effort, patience, and consistency. The system is not an automatic “get-rich-quick” program. Most successful users are people who regularly create content, drive traffic, build email lists, test strategies, and continue learning over time. Reviews across blogs and online communities repeatedly mention that results are closely connected to dedication and ongoing action.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div>There are some people who like the fact that everything is automated and easy for beginners, but there are also those who end up being disappointed since they were expecting instant money without making any effort. There are even other reviews that talk about some extra upselling and marketing costs which you might encounter once you sign up for the program.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
