        {
          "_name": "features20",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".item": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (min-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "4rem"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardText)": {
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardTitle)": {
                "& when (@showCardText)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showArrows)": {
                "align-items": "flex-start"
              },
              "&.last": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".step-number": {
              "padding-top": "6px"
            },
            ".icon-box": {
              "background": "@iconColor",
              "width": "60px",
              "min-width": "60px",
              "height": "60px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin-right": "2rem",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "margin-right": "1rem"
              },
              "& when (@showArrows)": {
                "&::before": {
                  "content": "\"\\e925\"",
                  "font-family": "Moririse2 !important",
                  "position": "absolute",
                  "font-size": "~\"@{arrowsSize}px\"",
                  "left": "50%",
                  "top": "~\"@{arrowsTop}%\"",
                  "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                    "top": "100%"
                  },
                  "color": "@iconColor",
                  "transform": "translate(-50%, 0)"
                }
              }
            },
            "span": {
              "font-size": "2rem",
              "color": "contrast(@iconColor, darken(@iconColor, 50%), #ffffff, 60%)"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".card": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".card-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "141%",
                    "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                      "top": "123%"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "114%"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".card-title, .card-box": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".icon-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features19\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"7\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Steps\" name=\"steps\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\" selected>9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\">\n        <header>Step</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrows\" name=\"showArrows\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Size\" name=\"arrowsSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"34\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Top\" name=\"arrowsTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" step=\"1\" value=\"99\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><div><b>Millionaire Partner System </b>caters to those who seek a simplified and systematic approach to start earning online money while avoiding all the complications of building their own business. This platform has a complete package of automation, done-for-you solutions, training, and mentoring in one package. It is particularly useful for beginners and busy individuals.</div></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Duis bibendum diam eu tellus cursus, sodales sollicitudin erat pulvinar. Quisque in mauris blandit, cursus ipsum non, hendrerit enim. Nullam fringilla ex sed maximus efficitur. Sed auctor justo elit, ac vestibulum metus semper non.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Create\n                                your own site</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Built for Long-Term Scalability</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">The system has not been developed just for novices; on the contrary, it has been created for those who wish to scale up in the long run. With increased expertise and more traffic, users might be able to expand their online venture using automation techniques.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 2}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><div><b>Beginner-Friendly Setup</b></div></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">One of the biggest reasons people choose Millionaire Partner System is because it removes many technical barriers that normally overwhelm beginners. Users do not need advanced coding skills, website design experience, or copywriting knowledge. The system provides pre-built sales funnels, landing pages, and automated email sequences that are already prepared and optimized for conversions.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 3}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Done-For-You Automation</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">The platform focuses heavily on automation, allowing users to operate an online business with less manual work. Once the funnels and email systems are activated, much of the lead capture and follow-up process works automatically. This makes it appealing for people who want to build semi-passive online income streams while reducing repetitive tasks.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 4}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>\n</b><div><b>High-Ticket Commission Potential</b></div></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>\n</div><div>Unlike many traditional affiliate programs that offer small commissions, Millionaire Partner System focus on promoting high ticket digital offers. This lets users make a bigger commission on each sale, rather than having to make a huge volume of sales. The model is designed to assist users in building their income more efficiently over time.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 4\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 5}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Step-by-Step Training &amp; Mentorship</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Other reasons why people choose the system include guided learning experience. Members get training videos, tutorials on driving traffic, live coaching, and community support to help make the concepts of affiliate marketing easier to understand. Beginners often prefer a structured roadmap rather than trying to learn everything on their own through trial and error.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 5\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 6}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Multiple Traffic Strategies</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">The system teaches free and paid traffic techniques such as social media marketing, YouTube, email marketing, short form video content, paid advertising, and more. This system is flexible enough to enable users to choose marketing strategies that suit their budget, experience, and long-term goals.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 6\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 7}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Saves Time &amp; Reduces Complexity</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>New entrepreneurs can spend months creating products, building websites, writing sales pages and providing customer support. The Millionaire Partner System makes it easy by giving you the business assets you need. This means people can spend more time learning marketing and building their audience, rather than building complex systems from scratch.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 7\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 8}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Community &amp; Ongoing Support</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Much of the appeal for many users stems from the community-driven nature of the platform. Users learn online business strategies through coaching calls, support groups and peer communities to stay motivated and accountable. This support structure can make the learning process less stressful and more encouraging for new learners.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 8\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 9}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Flexible Lifestyle Opportunity</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>Millionaire Partner Program is usually marketed as a versatile business concept that can be run from any place through an internet connection. The notion of earning additional income without having to deal with stock, office premises, and work schedule appeals to many users.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 9\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 10}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Built for Long-Term Scalability</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>This is not just an easy-to-use system that will benefit beginners, but also a system that would enable them to grow over time. As users get more experience and traffic, automation features and high-ticket programs can make this easier.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
