        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".item": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (min-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "4rem"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardText)": {
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showCardTitle)": {
                "& when (@showCardText)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "4rem"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@showArrows)": {
                "align-items": "flex-start"
              },
              "&.last": {
                ".icon-box": {
                  "&:before": {
                    "display": "none"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".step-number": {
              "padding-top": "6px"
            },
            ".icon-box": {
              "background": "@iconColor",
              "width": "60px",
              "min-width": "60px",
              "height": "60px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin-right": "2rem",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "margin-right": "1rem"
              },
              "& when (@showArrows)": {
                "&::before": {
                  "content": "\"\\e925\"",
                  "font-family": "Moririse2 !important",
                  "position": "absolute",
                  "font-size": "~\"@{arrowsSize}px\"",
                  "left": "50%",
                  "top": "~\"@{arrowsTop}%\"",
                  "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                    "top": "100%"
                  },
                  "color": "@iconColor",
                  "transform": "translate(-50%, 0)"
                }
              }
            },
            "span": {
              "font-size": "2rem",
              "color": "contrast(@iconColor, darken(@iconColor, 50%), #ffffff, 60%)"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".card": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".card-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              },
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "141%",
                    "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                      "top": "123%"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
              ".icon-box": {
                "& when (@showArrows)": {
                  "&::before": {
                    "top": "114%"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".card-title, .card-box": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".icon-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features20",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features19\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"7\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Steps\" name=\"steps\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\" selected>10</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\">\n        <header>Step</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrows\" name=\"showArrows\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Size\" name=\"arrowsSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"34\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Top\" name=\"arrowsTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" step=\"1\" value=\"99\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>The Millionaire Partner System offers </b>an easier method for constructing businesses online via automation, affiliate marketing, done-for-you solutions, and step-by-step assistance. This system is very much preferred by beginners and people who have other work commitments but wish to earn money online without having any experience. The following points highlight some of the key advantages that the Millionaire Partner System offers.</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Duis bibendum diam eu tellus cursus, sodales sollicitudin erat pulvinar. Quisque in mauris blandit, cursus ipsum non, hendrerit enim. Nullam fringilla ex sed maximus efficitur. Sed auctor justo elit, ac vestibulum metus semper non.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Create\n                                your own site</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Beginner-Friendly &amp; Easy to Start</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">The most important advantage of Millionaire Partner System is that it was made especially for starters. There is no need to be an expert in programming, web designing, or marketing to use it. With the help of this system, it will be possible to skip all the initial complications of creating a business from zero.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 2}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><div><b>Done-For-You Business Setup</b></div></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">The system comes with pre-existing sales funnels, landing pages, email sequences, and other marketing tools that are already built to turn visitors into customers. Users thus save a lot of time and the stress involved in creating everything from scratch. Rather than taking months developing a system, users get more time to learn about how to generate traffic.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 3}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Automation &amp; Passive Income Potential</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">The Millionaire Partner System is quite automated. Once the funnels and the e-mailing system is up and running, much of the process will be automated. This gives the user the ability to generate leads and make possible commissions even while not online. The creation of semi-passive income streams is one of the main attractions for many users.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 4}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>\n</b><div><b>High-Ticket Commission Opportunities</b></div></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>\n</div><div>In contrast to ordinary affiliate programs which provide very small commission rates, Millionaire Partner System deals with affiliate offers for high-end products. This means that users have an opportunity to make a greater amount of money by making fewer sales.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 4\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 5}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Step-by-Step Training &amp; Mentorship</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">The next big advantage is the education system built into the system itself. The user will receive training modules, video courses, live coaching, and marketing courses about affiliate marketing, traffic generation, leads, and conversions. This system is designed to prevent beginners from being overwhelmed.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 5\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 6}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Multiple Traffic Strategies</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Millionaire Partner Program teaches many different ways how to generate website traffic through social media marketing, YouTube, TikTok, email marketing, automation of content, and paid ads. It enables users to find the best strategy depending on their personality type and budget.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 6\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 7}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Saves Time &amp; Reduces Technical Stress</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>Starting a conventional online business may involve such complex tasks like product creation, creating copy, website creation, and learning some difficult software. Millionaire Partner System relieves people from many technicalities by offering them already built systems. Many people love that they do not have to think about technical issues.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 7\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 8}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Community Support &amp; Motivation</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">A lot of the users speak about the benefit of having a community and coaching atmosphere. According to the package that one subscribes to, one might have access to support groups, coaching calls, mentorship and accountability. The access to a community of marketers and other people in the community keeps the user motivated.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 8\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 9}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Flexible Work-From-Home Opportunity</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>It is an online business venture system that is highly flexible. This is due to the fact that Millionaire Partner System does not require you to have specific working hours at your disposal to manage. This works perfectly well for students, part-time entrepreneurs, busy executives, and even housewives.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 9\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 10}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Encourages Skill Development</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>Aside from the potential to earn money through Millionaire Partner System, this platform enables users to develop skills in digital marketing like building funnels, targeting audiences, creating content, email marketing, and lead generation. These are skills that can help in other ventures in online business and freelancing.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "features20-g",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "uSxZQNMPuo",
