        {
          "_name": "list2",
          "_sourceTheme": "tutorm5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 32px",
                "margin": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 20px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "0 4px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "margin": "0",
              ".title-wrapper": {
                ".mbr-section-title": {
                  "margin-bottom": "50px",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "margin-bottom": "32px"
                  }
                }
              },
              ".panel-group": {
                ".card": {
                  "border-bottom": "1px solid @border",
                  "border-radius": "0 !important",
                  "&:first-child": {
                    "border-top": "1px solid @border"
                  },
                  ".card-header": {
                    "padding": "32px 0",
                    "border-bottom": "none",
                    "background-color": "transparent",
                    ".panel-title": {
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "space-between",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "&:not(.collapsed)": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "transform": "rotate(-45deg)"
                        }
                      },
                      ".panel-title-edit": {
                        "margin-bottom": "0"
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "24px",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-out"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  ".panel-collapse": {
                    ".panel-body": {
                      "margin-bottom": "50px",
                      "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                        "margin-bottom": "32px"
                      },
                      ".mbr-text": {
                        "margin-bottom": "50px",
                        "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                          "margin-bottom": "32px"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 list2\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<header>Items</header>\n\t\t<select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#838383\" name=\"border\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFAQ\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What is the Millionaire Partner System?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">The Millionaire Partner System is presented as a business and partnership program designed to help participants learn how to promote products or offers and potentially generate commissions through referrals or sales. The system may provide training, resources, promotional materials, and guidance intended to help partners understand the process. Specific features, commission structures, eligibility requirements, and earning opportunities can vary, so prospective participants should review the official program terms carefully before joining.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>How does the Millionaire Partner System work?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">The system generally works by giving partners access to a structured process for promoting selected offers. Depending on the program, a partner may receive a unique tracking link or referral method that allows qualifying sales or actions to be attributed to them. When a transaction meets the program’s requirements, the partner may become eligible for a commission according to the applicable terms. Participants are responsible for following the program rules and any relevant advertising, disclosure, and consumer-protection requirements.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Can everyone make money with the Millionaire Partner System?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">No income level can be guaranteed. Results from a partnership or affiliate-style system can vary significantly depending on factors such as traffic, marketing skills, audience size, effort, offer selection, conversion rates, expenses, and market conditions. Any income claims should be evaluated carefully, and prospective partners should not assume that another participant’s results represent what they will personally earn. Before investing money or significant time, review the program's pricing, refund policy, commission terms, and any available earnings disclosures.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What should I consider before joining the Millionaire Partner System?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Before joining, carefully review how the program operates, what you receive for any fees paid, how commissions are calculated, when commissions are paid, and what promotional activities are permitted. Check whether there are recurring costs, minimum requirements, refund conditions, or restrictions on advertising. It is also important to understand that earning potential involves risk and effort rather than guaranteed income. Make your decision based on the official terms and information that can be independently verified.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Is VapoCept™ safe?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">As with any dietary supplement, safety depends on the individual, the ingredients, dosage, and other medications or supplements being used. People who are pregnant or breastfeeding, have a medical condition, or take prescription medication should consult a healthcare professional before using it.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
